    "text": "**Steal Body.** *Intelligence Saving Throw:* DC 12, one Small or Medium creature that has the Incapacitated condition, is a Humanoid or Beast, and has 10 Hit Points or fewer. *Failure:* The brain-crawler possesses the target, consumes its brain, and teleports inside its skull. While there, the brain-crawler has Total Cover against attacks and other effects originating outside its host. The brain-crawler retains its Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma; uses its understanding of Deep Speech; its telepathy; and its Detect Intelligence trait. It otherwise adopts the target's game statistics. It knows everything the target knew, including spells and languages. If the host body dies, the brain-crawler must leave it. The brain-crawler is also forced out if the target regains its devoured brain by means of a Wish spell.",
