    "text": "**Absorb Body:** *Strength Saving Throw:* DC 15, one Medium or Small creature the necrohulk can see within 5 feet. *Failure:* The target is pulled up to 10 feet into the necrohulk's space and becomes grafted to its body. The necrohulk can have only one target grafted at a time. While grafted, the target has the Restrained condition and Disadvantage on Constitution saving throws. When the necrohulk moves, the grafted target moves with it. The target dies while grafted, it is destroyed, and the necrohulk regains 10 Hit Points. A creature within 5 feet of the necrohulk can take an action to make a DC 15 Strength (Athletics) check. On a success, the target is no longer grafted and moves to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the necrohulk.\n\n---",
