  "actions": [
   {
    "text": "**Multiattack:** The ghost makes two Withering Touch attacks.",
    "name": "Multiattack",
    "kind": "other"
   },
   {
    "text": "**Withering Touch:** _Melee Weapon Attack:_ +5 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. _Hit:_ 19 (3d10 + 3) necrotic damage.",
    "name": "Withering Touch",
    "atk": 5,
    "reach": 5,
    "dmg": [
     {
      "n": 3,
      "die": 10,
      "bonus": 3,
      "type": "necrotic"
     }
    ],
    "kind": "melee"
   },
   {
    "text": "**Etherealness:** The ghost casts the Etherealness spell, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability. The ghost is visible on the Material Plane while it is in the Border Ethereal, and vice versa, but it can't affect or be affected by anything on the other plane.",
    "name": "Etherealness",
    "kind": "other"
   },
   {
    "text": "**Horrifying Visage:** Wisdom Saving Throw: DC 13, each creature in a 60-foot Cone that can see the ghost and isn't an Undead. Failure: 10 (2d6 + 3) psychic damage, and the target has the Frightened condition until the start of the ghost's next turn. Success: The target is immune to this ghost's Horrifying Visage for 24 hours.",
    "name": "Horrifying Visage",
    "dmg": [
     {
      "n": 2,
      "die": 6,
      "bonus": 3,
      "type": "psychic"
     }
    ],
    "saveDC": 13,
    "saveAbility": "wis",
    "kind": "save"
   },
   {
    "text": "**Possession (Recharge 6):** Charisma Saving Throw: DC 13, one Humanoid the ghost can see within 5 feet. Failure: The target is possessed by the ghost; the ghost disappears, and the target is Incapacitated and loses control of its body. The ghost now controls the body but the target retains awareness. The ghost can't be targeted by any attack, spell, or other effect, except those that specifically target Undead. The ghost's game statistics are the same, except it uses the possessed target's Speed, as well as the target's Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution modifiers. The possession lasts until the body drops to 0 Hit Points or the ghost leaves as a Bonus Action. When the possession ends, the ghost appears in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of the body. Success: The target is immune to this ghost's Possession for 24 hours.\n\n---",
    "name": "Possession (Recharge 6)",
    "saveDC": 13,
    "saveAbility": "cha",
    "recharge": "6",
    "kind": "save"
   }
  ],
  "bonus": [],
