    "text": "**Rampage (1/Day).** Immediately after dealing damage to a creature that is already Bloodied, the gnoll moves up to half its Speed, and it makes one Rend attack.\n\n---",
    "name": "Rampage (1/Day)",
    "perDay": "1/Day",
